 suitable for offices and server rooms.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>16 × 10/100/1000 Mbps Gigabit Ethernet ports</li><li>Supports PoE (802.3af) and PoE+ (802.3at)</li><li>Total PoE power budget up to 76W</li><li>Unmanaged, plug-and-play operation</li><li>Fanless design for silent performance</li><li>Rackmount and desktop installation support</li><li>Energy Efficient Ethernet (IEEE 802.3az)</li><li>Durable metal housing for professional use</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco Nexus 9300 N9K-C93180YC-EX 48x 10/25GbE SFP28 + 6x 100GbE QSFP28 Network Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-9300-n9k-c93180yc-ex-48x-1025gbe-sfp28-6x-100gbe-qsfp28-network-switch","now":"155,000৳","old":"160,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ L3 Web Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-l3-web-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"24,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco Nexus N3K-3064PQ-10GX –48-Port 10G SFP+ Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-n3k-3064pq-10gx-%E2%80%9348-port-10g-sfp-switch","now":"70,000৳","old":"75,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba Networking CX 8325-32C 32-Port 100G QSFP+/QSFP28 Data Center/Core Switch","href":"/hpe-aruba-networking-cx-8325-32c-32-port-100g-qsfpqsfp28-data-centercore-switch","now":"270,000৳","old":"280,000৳","single":""},{"name":"BDCOM S2900-8T4X 4-Port 10G + 8-Port Gigabit L3-Lite Managed Switch","href":"/bdcom-s2900-8t4x-4-port-10g-8-port-gigabit-l3-lite-managed-switch","now":"14,500৳","old":"15,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ 4x10G SFP+ 4x10GBase-T RJ45 L2 Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-4x10g-sfp-4x10gbase-t-rj45-l2-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"25,000৳","old":"26,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 4-Port 2.5G & 2-Port 10G Simple L2 Smart Managed Ethernet Network Switc